<title>USA: Aradigm names Olbert CFO.</title>
<headline>Aradigm names Olbert CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWARD, Calif. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aradigm Corp said on Tuesday that it has named Mark Olbert chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Olbert was previously Director of Mergers and Acquisitions Amgen Inc.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to say whom Olbert replaces.</p>
